Meditate on your link with Nature.

While meditating, your equilibrium decreases by [9.11, 12, 13, 15, 17 (TL1-5; MP 100)] per turn, your Mental Save is increased by [27, 35, 41, 46, 51 (TL1-5; MP 100)], and your healing factor increases by [21%, 27%, 32%, 35%, 39% (TL1-5; MP 100)].

Your deep meditation does not let you deal damage correctly, reducing the damage you and your summons deal by 50%.

Also, any time you are resting (even with Meditation not sustained) you enter a simple meditative state that decreases your equilibrium by [0.50, 1.08, 1.59, 2.06, 2.50 (TL1-5)] per turn.

The activated effects increase with your Mindpower.
